#
# Re-apply the active Perf Control profile's CPU/GPU clock caps at boot.
# sysfs frequency caps do not persist across reboot (neither ROCKNIX nor the
# Steam plugin restore them), so without this an underclock would be lost after
# every reboot. The fan curve is NOT touched here: cooling.profile +
# fancontrol.conf already persist in /storage and the fancontrol service reads
# them at boot. Backgrounded so it never delays boot.

[ -x /usr/bin/perfcontrol ] && /usr/bin/perfcontrol boot >/dev/null 2>&1 &
exit 0
